<item><title>Mondlane denies inciting violence as prosecutors question him</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mondlane-denies-inciting-violence-as-prosecutors-question-eceb56/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mondlane-denies-inciting-violence-as-prosecutors-question-eceb56/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The opposition leader acknowledged calling demonstrations after Mozambique&apos;s disputed 2024 elections but said his appeal to supporters was a political metaphor.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:03:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mozambique lawyers’ order opens discipline case against Shamir Mendes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-lawyers-order-opens-discipline-case-against-24e7ec/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-lawyers-order-opens-discipline-case-against-24e7ec/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The order says Mendes is a first-phase trainee, not a registered lawyer, and cannot practise during his first eight months of training.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:52:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chapo pledges over three billion meticais to rebuild damaged public infrastructure</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/chapo-pledges-over-three-billion-meticais-to-rebuild-f04713/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/chapo-pledges-over-three-billion-meticais-to-rebuild-f04713/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The investment is for public facilities destroyed during demonstrations that followed Mozambique’s 2024 general elections.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:53:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mozambique launches mining company with 850 million meticais</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-launches-mining-company-with-850-million-meticais-1a9442/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-launches-mining-company-with-850-million-meticais-1a9442/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The state-owned ENM is tasked with managing strategic minerals and taking part in their exploration, processing and sale.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:24:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-launches-mining-company-with-850-million-meticais-1a9442/share.jpg" length="43882" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-launches-mining-company-with-850-million-meticais-1a9442/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Rights group demands police inquiry into alleged press attacks at Mondlane trial</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/rights-group-demands-police-inquiry-into-alleged-press-e583c1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/rights-group-demands-police-inquiry-into-alleged-press-e583c1/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The group says a police officer took a journalist’s microphone and assaulted a camera operator near Mozambique’s Supreme Court in Maputo.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:48:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
